installation, then open **Plugins → Store**. Store installations use the host'"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"s\n`pluginManager.installBundle` service, which owns the active profile, package\nmanager, locking and"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" rollback. Web and custom profiles use that same service.\nThe install response reports the actual pr"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ofile and whether a restart is needed.\nThe host must provide `profileContext` and `pluginManager`. N"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"o alternate profile\nis selected when either service is unavailable."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The commands below describe the older published Web preview. The source build\nabove includes the cur"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"w describe the older published Web preview. The source build\nabove includes the current-profile fix."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Try the preview"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install the prebuilt Preview 5 tarball into a public DeepSeek Harness\n`0.1.0-rc.8` Web profile:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The versioned tarball prevents a later change on `main` from silently changing\nthe code you install "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"and avoids git dependency build permissions. `-w` confirms\nthat the Web profile is the pnpm workspac"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"e root. Restart DSH Web, open\n**Settings**, and select **Store**. This is a preview integration: rev"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"iew the\nsource before installation."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## What it solves"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The DSH ecosystem is growing quickly, but finding a plugin still means searching GitHub, checking co"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"mpatibility, and copying install commands by hand. DSH Plugin Store creates one discovery layer for "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"developers and agents."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Browse more than 4,000 plugin packages across 3,400 community repositories\n- Search by name, repos"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"itory, description, or category\n- Filter with the complete leaderboard tag taxonomy\n- Sort by leader"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"board rank, GitHub stars, or weekly growth\n- Install catalog entries into a local DSH Web profile\n- "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"Inspect plugins already loaded by Cordis\n- Let agents search the same catalog through native tools"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Native Store experience"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The current native Settings integration targets the public DeepSeek Harness\n`0.1.0-rc.8` package bou"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ndary and is prepared for upstream collaboration. It includes:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Real preview: the Community view filtered by the Desktop tag."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- `Community` and `Installed` tabs\n- Server-side tag filtering and pagination\n- Same-origin catalog "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"proxy without browser CORS dependency\n- Local profile installation with validation and error feedbac"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"k\n- Live Cordis Loader inventory\n- Responsive light and dark UI"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The hosted catalog remains available while the native integration is finalized against the public Ha"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"rness package release."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Agent tools"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `store_search` | Search by name, description, and category. |\n| `store_catalog` | Browse and rank "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"catalog entries. |\n| `store_install` | Return reviewed installation instructions. |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Reproducible development installation"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness is evolving rapidly. For the current source integration, clone\nthis repository into"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" a Harness checkout, install the workspace, and build the\nhost and Web client faces:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Then enable the bundle in the Web profile:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The release tarball installs the committed Host and Web client artifacts.\nPreview 5 declares public "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"rc.8 runtime peers, uses the rc.8 `insert` patch\nschema, and installs only Leaderboard runtime-verif"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"ied npm package specs. Its\npackage graph, Host entrypoint, composed profile configuration, and Store"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"-button\ninstallation path are verified in an isolated DSH environment. The\nsource-checkout path abov"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"e remains the development route for rebuilding\nartifacts inside the Harness workspace."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Installing a plugin may download and execute third-party code, including package lifecycle scripts. "},{"id":"p37s2","text":"Review source repositories before installation. Enterprise deployments should place the catalog behi"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"nd an organizational review and allowlist process."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The native installer validates GitHub repository identifiers, requires the selected catalog entry to"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" be runtime-verified, resolves its exact npm package spec from the Leaderboard detail API, and rejec"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ts URLs, git specs, shell syntax, and unverified entries."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Report security issues through GitHub's\nprivate vulnerability reporting,\nnot a public issue. See the"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" full security policy for supported\nversions, trust boundaries, and disclosure guidance."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"- [x] Searchable community catalog\n- [x] Agent discovery tools\n- [x] Native Community and Installed "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"tabs\n- [x] Tag filters, sorting, and pagination\n- [x] Local Web profile installer\n- [ ] Upstream rev"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"iew with DeepSeek Harness\n- [ ] Stable npm release aligned with public DSH packages\n- [ ] Update, di"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"sable, and uninstall workflows\n- [ ] Enterprise catalog allowlists and audit events"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Help us reach 100 stars"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"If a native plugin marketplace would make DeepSeek Harness more useful for you, star this repository"},{"id":"p43s2","text":" and share one plugin workflow you want supported."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"We are looking for:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- Plugin authors who want better distribution\n- Harness users willing to test the native Store\n- Ent"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"erprise teams with private catalog and audit requirements"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Open an issue or join the discussion through the repository."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Related projects"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness\n- DSH Plugin Leaderboard\n- Sandbase Harness\n- DeepSeek Harness Handbook"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
